    "description": "Add-on for the UniFi Security app. Parsing for Ubiquiti UniFi (UDM Pro, UniFi APs/switches, UniFi Protect). Splits syslog into ubiquiti:unifi:cef / ubiquiti:unifi / ubiquiti:unifi:ap / ubiquiti:unifi:switch, corrects host, and maps CEF SIEM-integration events to CIM.",
